{"id":"97d061d52c649fe2a8660e94d8a251661cb7de8f","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"97d061d52c649fe2a8660e94d8a251661cb7de8f","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/doctor-shadowed-pnpm.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"pacquet\": minor","+---","+","+`pnpm doctor` now warns in its \"Install method\" check when the `pnpm` found on PATH is a copy pnpm did not install. The warning names that copy. If pnpm recognizes its installer, it also gives the command that removes it."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":".changeset/warn-on-shadowed-pnpm.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"pacquet\": minor","+---","+","+`pnpm self-update` and `pnpm setup` now warn when another `pnpm` on PATH comes before the global bin directory, because the shell would keep running that copy. The warning names that copy. If pnpm recognizes how it was installed (npm, Homebrew, Corepack, Volta, or Scoop), the warning also gives the command that removes it."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args.rs","lines":["@@ -93,6 +93,7 @@ pub mod search;"," pub mod self_update;"," pub mod set_script;"," pub mod setup;","+pub(crate) mod shadowing_pnpm;"," pub mod shim;"," pub mod stage;"," pub mod star;"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/doctor.rs","lines":["@@ -8,6 +8,7 @@"," //! moving its dist-tags, so what gates a release is what ships to users."," "," mod filesystem;","+mod install_method;"," mod probe_path;"," "," use crate::{","@@ -16,6 +17,7 @@ use crate::{"," };"," use clap::Args;"," use filesystem::check_filesystem_capabilities;","+use install_method::check_install_method;"," use pnpm_config::{","     Config,","     PNPM_VERSION,","@@ -144,7 +146,7 @@ impl DoctorArgs {","     pub async fn run(&self, config: &Config) -> miette::Result<DoctorResult> {","         prefetch_config_paths(config);","         let mut checks =","-            vec![check_versions(), check_in